      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Reset a planned week\n\nClears every calendar row for one Plan Week so the planner can rebuild it. Use it after the copy in the feed changes — editing 26 rows by hand is how a calendar drifts out of sync with what the generator actually produces.\n\nSet the Sunday date in **Week to Reset**, run, then run **BP — Weekly Content Planner** with its Plan Now trigger.\n\nRows at Status = Published are skipped. A published post is a record of something that happened.",
